#| "\n"
#| "If you are not yet confident with your keyboard, that is completely fine. "
#| "NVDA has a built-in tool called Input Help. Press NVDA and the number 1 "
#| "together to turn it on. While Input Help is active, pressing any key "
#| "tells you what that key does without actually doing it. Press NVDA+1 "
#| "again to turn it off. You can use Input Help at any time, even during a "
#| "lesson.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "If you have an assistive technology instructor nearby, let them know you "
#| "are starting NVDA Coach. They can help you find keys, adjust settings, or "
