#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:723
msgid ""
"--- KEYS AVAILABLE DURING EVERY LESSON ---\n"
"These function keys work at any time while a lesson is open:\n"
"\n"
"  Enter  —  Confirm you have tried the step and move to the next one.\n"
"  F1  —  Repeat the current instruction. Use this whenever you want NVDA to "
"read the step again.\n"
"  F2  —  Hear a hint. If you are not sure what to do, press F2 for a helpful "
"suggestion. Press it again for additional hints.\n"
"  F3  —  Skip the current step and move on. Use this if you cannot complete "
"a step right now and want to continue.\n"
"  Escape  —  Stop the lesson. Press Escape three times to close NVDA Coach.\n"
"\n"
"--- KEYS AVAILABLE ANY TIME IN THIS WINDOW ---\n"
"These keys work whether a lesson is running or not:\n"
"\n"
"  F4  —  Open the NVDA Coach help documentation in your web browser. Press "
"F4 once to arm it, then press F4 again within five seconds to open.\n"
"  F5  —  Send feedback to the developer by email. Press F5 once to arm it, "
"then press F5 again within five seconds to open.\n"
"  F6  —  Toggle lesson sounds on or off. Press once to silence sounds, press "
"again to restore them.\n"
"  F7  —  Open your profile. Set your name, your instructor's name, and your "
"training center. This information personalizes your lessons and appears on "
"your certificate of completion.\n"
"\n"
"--- LESSON NAVIGATION ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  —  Move to the next lesson in the current chapter.\n"
"  Ctrl+B  —  Go back to the previous lesson.\n"
"  Ctrl+R  —  Restart the current lesson from the beginning.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"--- 每节课中随时可用的按键 ---\n"
"课程打开期间，以下功能键随时可用：\n"
"\n"
"  回车键  ——  确认你已试过这一步，并进入下一步。\n"
"  F1  ——  重复当前指令。任何时候想让 NVDA 再读一遍这一步，都可以用它。\n"
"  F2  ——  听一条提示。如果你不确定该做什么，按 F2 会给你一条有用的建议。再按"
"一次可获得更多提示。\n"
"  F3  ——  跳过当前步骤，继续往下。如果这一步你现在无法完成、又想继续，可以用"
"它。\n"
"  Escape  ——  停止课程。连按三次 Escape 可关闭 NVDA Coach。\n"
"\n"
"--- 在本窗口中随时可用的按键 ---\n"
"无论课程是否正在进行，以下按键都可用：\n"
"\n"
"  F4  ——  在网页浏览器中打开 NVDA Coach 帮助文档。先按一次 F4 预备，再在五秒"
"内按一次 F4 打开。\n"
"  F5  ——  通过电子邮件向开发者发送反馈。先按一次 F5 预备，再在五秒内按一次 "
"F5 打开。\n"
"  F6  ——  开启或关闭课程声音。按一次静音，再按一次恢复。\n"
"  F7  ——  打开你的个人资料。设置你的姓名、讲师姓名和培训中心。这些信息会让你"
"的课程更个性化，并显示在你的结业证书上。\n"
"\n"
"--- 课程导航 ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  ——  移动到当前章节的下一课。\n"
"  Ctrl+B  ——  返回上一课。\n"
"  Ctrl+R  ——  从头重新开始当前这一课。\n"
"\n"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:750
msgid ""
"When you are ready to begin, press Tab to find the Start Course button below "
"and press Enter or Space to start the first lesson. You can also press "
"NVDA+Shift+C to open the lesson picker and choose any lesson directly."
msgstr ""
"准备好开始时，按 Tab 找到下方的“开始课程”按钮，然后按回车键或空格键开始第一"
"课。你也可以按 NVDA+Shift+C 打开课程选择器，直接选择任意一课。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:781
msgid "Ready, {name}."
msgstr "准备就绪，{name}。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:781
msgid "Ready."
msgstr "就绪。"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:789
msgid ""
"--- WHAT TO DO NEXT ---\n"
"  Press NVDA+Shift+C to open the lesson picker and choose a lesson.\n"
"\n"
"--- LESSON NAVIGATION ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  —  Move to the next lesson in this category.\n"
"  Ctrl+B  —  Go back to the previous lesson.\n"
"  Ctrl+R  —  Restart this lesson from the beginning.\n"
"\n"
"The Control key (Ctrl) is in the bottom-left corner of your keyboard.\n"
"\n"
"--- NEW TO KEYBOARD NAVIGATION? ---\n"
"Use NVDA Input Help: press NVDA+1 to turn it on, press any key to hear what "
"it does without anything happening, then press NVDA+1 to turn it off.\n"
"\n"
"--- A NOTE FOR INSTRUCTORS AND STUDENTS ---\n"
"If an instructor is present, this is a great time to ask any questions "
"before the next lesson. If you are working independently, keep going at your "
"own pace. Every step forward counts.\n"
"\n"
"--- QUICK KEYS (available any time in this window) ---\n"
"  F4 — Open help documentation\n"
"  F5 — Send feedback to the developer\n"
"  F6 — Toggle lesson sounds on or off\n"
"  F7 — Set your name and instructor's name"
msgstr ""
"--- 接下来做什么 ---\n"
"  按 NVDA+Shift+C 打开课程选择器，选择一课。\n"
"\n"
"--- 课程导航 ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  ——  移动到本类别的下一课。\n"
"  Ctrl+B  ——  返回上一课。\n"
"  Ctrl+R  ——  从头重新开始这一课。\n"
"\n"
"Control 键（Ctrl）位于键盘的左下角。\n"
"\n"
"--- 刚接触键盘导航？ ---\n"
"使用 NVDA 输入帮助：按 NVDA+1 开启，按任意键即可听到它的作用而不会真的执行，"
"然后按 NVDA+1 关闭。\n"
"\n"
"--- 给讲师和学员的提示 ---\n"
"如果有讲师在场，现在正是在下一课之前提问的好时机。如果你是独自学习，就按自己"
"的节奏继续。每向前一步都算数。\n"
"\n"
"--- 快捷键（在本窗口中随时可用） ---\n"
"  F4 —— 打开帮助文档\n"
"  F5 —— 向开发者发送反馈\n"
"  F6 —— 开启或关闭课程声音\n"
"  F7 —— 设置你的姓名和讲师姓名"

#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:816
